  "slug": "golden-leaves-con",
  "name": "Golden Leaves Con",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Golden Leaves Con (GLC) is an annual Swiss furry convention held in November with an autumn theme and run by the Swissfurs Association. It is currently the only active public furry convention in Switzerland since CH-on ended in 2012. Rather than being catered by a hotel, it is run by a crew of volunteer furries, with all meals and drinks included in the fee to keep it affordable for international guests, and it features a heated outdoor pool and complimentary cocktails one night. A main event is a full-length puppetry show by the Swiss Pawpeteers, the only pawpet production in German. GLC has no guests of honor or charity. The first convention was held November 4 to 7, 2010, and the tenth, in Hasliberg in 2019, drew 299 attendees.",
